      "description": "SGB V — Sozialgesetzbuch (Fünftes Buch) / Social Code Book V (statutory health insurance)",
      "weight": 100,
      "data": {
        "official_name": "Sozialgesetzbuch (SGB) Fünftes Buch (V) — Gesetzliche Krankenversicherung",
        "common_name": "SGB V",
        "alternate_names": [
          "Social Code Book V",
          "SGB 5"
        ],
        "description": "German Social Code Book V governing statutory health insurance (Gesetzliche Krankenversicherung).",
        "notes": "German statutory health-insurance code. §393 (in force 2024-07-01) governs cloud use in healthcare and mandates a BSI C5 attestation.",
        "urls": [
          {
            "type": "legal_text",
            "url": "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/sgb_5/"
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          "§393",
          "393"
        ]
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "patterns": [
            "^§?\\s?393$",
            "(?i)^sgb-?v-393$"
          ],
          "description": "§393 SGB V — Cloud-Einsatz im Gesundheitswesen; statutory mandate for a BSI C5 attestation",
          "weight": 100,
          "data": {
            "official_name": "§ 393 SGB V — Cloud-Einsatz im Gesundheitswesen; Verordnungsermächtigung",
            "description": "Permits processing of health data via cloud services only where the provider holds a current BSI C5 attestation (C5-Typ1 until 2025-06-30, C5-Typ2 from 2025-07-01; a comparable or higher-security standard may substitute, as determined by the BMG together with the BSI). In force 2024-07-01.",
            "notes": "Statutory mandate for BSI C5 in the German healthcare / statutory-health-insurance sector — this is the law that *references* C5, whereas C5 itself is the control catalogue. Cross-reference: the mandated control catalogue is secid:control/bsi.bund.de/c5 (AI companion: secid:control/bsi.bund.de/ai-c4). This law→control link will be formalized in the Relationships layer (SPEC §6); documented here in notes for now.",
            "url": "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/sgb_5/__393.html",
            "examples": [
              {
                "input": "§393",
                "url": "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/sgb_5/__393.html"
              },
              {
                "input": "393",
                "url": "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/sgb_5/__393.html"
              },
              {
                "input": "sgb-v-393",
                "url": "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/sgb_5/__393.html"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
